<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - National Golf cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - National Golf cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said Tuesday it had cut its rating for National Golf Properties Inc to intermediate-term accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch kept its rating of long-term buy on the shares.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed Tuesday at 34-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
